     "content_html": "1242<sub>6</sub>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Do the one’s place first.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 3 + 5 = 8 = 6 + 2</p>\n<p>In base 6: 12</p>\n<p>One’s place: 2</p>\n<p>Carry: 1</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 1 + 5 + 4 = 10 = 6 + 4</p>\n<p>In base 6: 14</p>\n<p>This column: 4</p>\n<p>Carry: 1</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 1 + 4 + 3 = 8 = 6 + 2</p>\n<p>In base 6: 12</p>\n<p>This column: 12</p>\n<p>Carry: You don’t need to carry because there are no more columns.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{1242_6}\"></span></p>\n"
    }
